# Credential stuffing, core rules acting. One address tries eleven accounts
# in a few minutes, none of them signed in: the eleventh attempt is held and
# named. A network where failures outnumber sign-ins tenfold is named too.
# enforce
# network: 203.0.113.0 203.0.113.255 64601 NL Bulk Hosting
